			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> god, you youngins are silly. Way back in my day <a href=\"https://mstdn.social/tags/FOSS\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#<span>FOSS</span></a> devs had to give blow jobs on street corners to pay for a dialup connection between 5 guys living in a 2  bedroom house next to a liberal college campus with Sun machines had to all share. And you're telling me people get PAID for this now? Where might I accept bribes?</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
